  "bodyHash": "2fa42899357b41f2",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/31qnTHav/images/9bcdf20013cd9ac82325a0b7c3540ddf05644af9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/Diversity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diversity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffaewufs-diversity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaewulf.xyz%252fdiscord%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-singular\"></a></p>\n<div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaewulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"kofi-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252ffaewulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"paypal-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/paypal-singular_vector.svg\"></a></div>\n<hr>\n<h2>📖 概述</h2>\n<p>Diversity（多样性）是一款 Minecraft 模组，引入了广泛的功能以增强游戏体验。从生活便利改进到新生物行为和随机趣味内容，这款模组提供了丰富多样的小功能。该模组也设计为支持仅服务端安装。</p>\n<p><strong>当前功能数量：68 个（最新版本中新增 1 个）</strong></p>\n<h3>2.4.0 版本更新内容？</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>甘蔗现在可以种植在具有 <code>diversity:strong_support_sugarcane</code> 标签的方块上，且不再需要附近有水。默认支持的方块包括：泥巴、泥泞的红树林根须。</li>\n<li>现在需要安装 <code>Faewulf's Lib</code> 作为库依赖。对此带来的不便深表歉意。</li>\n<li><code>Beacon Extended</code> 模块将信标的范围和持续时间扩展到等级 4 以上！每增加一个等级（超过 4 级），范围增加 20 格，最高可达 10 级。</li>\n<li>新增 <code>Day counter</code>（天数计数器）选项，可更改白天时间刻度（仅限了解其作用的用户修改）。</li>\n<li>狐狸在吃浆果后会自动繁殖。</li>\n<li>为 bundles（束口袋）添加了两个新附魔：<code>Vacuum</code>（自动吸入背包中新拾取的物品）和 <code>Selective Vacuum</code>（仅吸入束口袋中已存在的同类物品）。</li>\n<li>为 <code>Spy glass what is that?</code>（间谍镜功能）增加了额外配置选项（使用范围、显示信息、距离、名称）。</li>\n<li><code>No saddled mobs wandering</code>（骑乘生物不徘徊，取代了之前的“无驯服马匹徘徊”）现在影响所有可以佩戴鞍的生物。（支持模组生物）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>⚠️ 1.20.1 版本注意事项</h3>\n<p>该模组的原版针对 1.21 版本开发，<code>1.20.1</code> 的移植版将缺少部分功能，且目前没有计划重新添加这些功能：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>1 刻延迟的灯泡方块</li>\n<li>随机大小的鱼类</li>\n<li>更小的蜜蜂</li>\n<li>战锤旋转方块</li>\n<li>自定义附魔非数据驱动。若禁用此功能可使模组仅服务端运行（或启用，但客户端也必须安装该模组）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>✨ 功能特性</h2>\n<h3>额外合成配方</h3>\n<p>束口袋合成配方</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/recipes/bundleRecipe.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Bundle Recipe\"></p></div>\n<p>可疑的沙/砾石</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/recipes/susSand.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Bundle Recipe\"><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/recipes/susGravel.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Bundle Recipe\"></p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>生活便利改进</h3>\n<p>1 刻延迟铜灯泡（默认禁用）（仅 1.21 版本）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>使铜灯泡方块的延迟变为 1 刻，如同快照版本中的表现。</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/1tickdelayBulbBlock-min.gif?raw=true\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/raw/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/1tickdelayBulbBlock-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"1tick Delay Bulb\"></a></p></div>\n<p>备份附魔类型（仅 1.21 服务端可用）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;添加四种保护类附魔的弱化版本。\\n这些附魔提供与原版相同的额外保护效果，但威力仅为原版的 25%。</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/backup_enchantment.png?raw=true\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/raw/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/backup_enchantment.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Enchantment Backup preview\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/backup_enchantment-min.gif?raw=true\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/raw/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/backup_enchantment-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Enchantment Backup\"></a></p></div>\n<p>战利品旗帜</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;添加一些类似不祥旗帜的战利品旗帜。通过 Boss 掉落、牧羊人村民礼物（村庄英雄）等方式获得...</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/trophyBanner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Trophy banners\"></p></div>\n<p>束口袋附魔（仅 1.21 服务端可用）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;为束口袋添加 2 种附魔（补充容量和增加容量）。如果模组安装在客户端，槽位指示器将正确计算。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/bundleEnchantment-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Bundle enchantments\"></p></div>\n<p>更好的附魔台</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>附魔台可以接受放置在两格外的书架，并能透过非实体方块看到书架。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/expandedEnchatingTable.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Expanded Enchanting Table\"></p></div>\n<p>骨粉珊瑚扇/方块</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;珊瑚扇和珊瑚方块可以使用骨粉（仅限温暖海洋生物群系）生长成珊瑚礁。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/bonemealCoral.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Bonemeal corals\"></p></div>\n<p>骨粉小花朵</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>种植在菌丝体上的小花朵（除了凋零玫瑰和火把花）可以使用骨粉使其向周围扩散。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/bonemealSmallFlower.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Bonemeal small flowers\"></p></div>\n<p>穿透墙壁点击告示牌和物品展示框</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>允许在手持物品时，右键点击放置在箱子、 barrels 或潜影盒（容器方块）上的告示牌和物品展示框。行为完全如同正常打开的容器。<br>Shift+右键可旋转物品/编辑告示牌。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/clickThrough.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Click Through Sign and ItemFrame\"></p></div>\n<p>天数计数器</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;记录经过的天数</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/day_counter-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Day counter\"></p></div>\n<p>深板岩生成器</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;如果在 Y 轴 8 以下有岩浆+水，深板岩将替代石头和圆石。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/deepslate_generator-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Deepslate generator\"></p></div>\n<p>隐形物品展示框</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;通过对未染色的玻璃板 Shift+右键点击来使物品展示框隐形。当持有物品时它们保持隐形，否则会以粒子作为指示器。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/invisibleItemFrame.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Invisible ItemFrame\"></p></div>\n<p>更快的铜块氧化</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>铜块及其变体在雨中和水中氧化速度更快。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/fasterOxidization.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Faster Copper Block Oxidation\"></p></div>\n<p>更快的矿车</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;放置在“砾石”上的铁轨将使矿车及其变体行驶得更快。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/fasterMinecart.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"FasterMinecart\"></p></div>\n<p>发光浆果给予发光效果</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/glow-berries_glow-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Glow berries give glow effect\"></p></div>\n<p>潜影盒标签</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;潜影盒放置后会显示其自定义名称。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/shulkerLabel.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Shulker box label\"></p></div>\n<p>可用的空可疑沙/砾石</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;你可以向空的 suspicious sand 和 gravel 中添加物品（通过 Shift+右键）。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/usableSusBlock.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Suspicious Sand/Gravel\"></p></div>\n<p>无经验值限制的砧</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;移除砧上的“过于昂贵”限制。在客户端仍会显示“过于昂贵”标签，但仍可正常使用。</p></div>\n<p>农田不被踩踏</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;如果实体（包括玩家）穿着摔落缓冲靴或拥有缓降效果，农田不会被踩踏。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/farmlandTrampling.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"No farmland trampling\"></p></div>\n<p>作物掉落经验</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>收获作物时获得经验值。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/xpCrops.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"XP from Crops\"></p></div>\n<p>睡眠而不设置重生点</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;潜行并右键点击床即可睡眠，而不会更改重生点。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/skipSetSpawnPoint.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Sleep Without Setting Respawn Point\"></p></div>\n<p>火把点燃目标</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;如果任何实体手持火把或灵魂火把，目标将会被点燃。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/torch_fire_attack-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"torch_light_fire\"></p></div>\n<p>（重构）睡眠不跳过天气变化（默认禁用）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>睡眠不会清除天气状态。<br>RAIN_ONLY 将只保留下雨。<br>ALL_WEATHER 将保留下雨和雷暴（此模式下雷暴时无法睡眠）&nbsp;</p></div>\n<p>清洗已填充的地图</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>使用炼药锅清洗已填充的地图。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/washingFilledmap.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Washing Maps\"></p></div>\n<p>潜行穿过甜浆果丛</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;潜行状态下穿过甜浆果丛。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/sneakingSweetBerry.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Sneaking Sweet Berry\"></p></div>\n<p>裤子保护免受甜浆果伤害</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;穿着裤子可防止受到甜浆果丛的伤害。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/sneakingSweetBerry.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Pants Protect from Sweet Berry\"></p></div>\n<p>更快的玻璃/萤石开采</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;镐子开采玻璃相关方块和萤石的速度更快。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/glassblockMining.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Faster Pickaxe Mining\"></p></div>\n<p>四元素画作</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;2x2 的四元素画作现在可以在生存模式放置。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/elementPaintings.png?raw=true\" alt=\"4 Element Painting\"></p></div>\n<p>湿海绵在温暖生物群系干燥</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>放置在温暖生物群系的湿海绵最终会干燥</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/wetsponge_dry_warmbiome-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"wetsponge_dries_warmbiomes\"></p></div>\n<p>未定义</p>\n<h3>物品调整</h3>\n<p>束口袋可放置方块</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>按住束口袋并 Shift+左键点击地面切换到放置模式。然后可以放置束口袋内的方块。</p><h3><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/bundlePlaceBlocks-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"bundlePlaceBlock\"></h3></div>\n<p>锄头可收割多种作物</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;锄头可以收割范围内的作物。默认为 3x3，钻石和下界合金锄头为 5x5。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/AutoHarvest.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"HieHarvestCrops\"></p></div>\n<p>战锤可旋转方块（仅 1.21 版本）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;使用战锤（潜行+右键）在可能的情况下旋转方向性方块。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/maceRotateBlocks-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"maceRotateBlock\"></p></div>\n<p>剪刀解除 TNT 引信</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;剪刀可用于正在燃烧的 TNT，有一定几率解除引信。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/shearDefuseTNT.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"ShearDefuseTNT\"></p></div>\n<p>剪刀防止植物生长</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;剪刀可用于“树苗”、“竹子”、“藤蔓”和“甘蔗”以防止其生长。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/shearPreventPlantGrow.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"ShearPreventPlantGrow\"></p></div>\n<p>剪刀对村民进行扒窃</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;在潜行时使用“剪切”动作对村民进行扒窃。尝试从正面扒窃很容易激怒他们；通过从背后扒窃可以降低风险，或使用隐身药水完全消除风险。扒窃村民有几率重置其职业。职业等级越高，重置的几率越低。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/pickpocketVillager.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"ShearPickpocketVillager\"></p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>望远镜 “那是什么？”</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;使用望远镜查看额外的方块/实体信息（音符盒、循声守卫冷却时间、红石信号强度、熔炉内储存的经验值等），默认范围为5格，使用望远镜缩放后范围可延伸至32格。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/spyglassWhatIsThat-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"spyglassHUD\"></p></div>\n<p>时钟显示时间</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>使用时钟显示当前世界的时刻。</p></div>\n<p>时钟查看村民日程</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;手持时钟并右键点击任意工作台方块，即可查看村民的工作日程。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/clockCheckSchedule-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"clockSchedule\"></p></div>\n<p>三叉戟可召唤雷暴（灵感源自“Storm channeling”原版修改）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;如果在最高Y轴投掷带有引雷附魔且耐久度大于50%的三叉戟至天空，将召唤雷暴。作为交换，三叉戟将失去引雷附魔并耗尽所有耐久度（但不会损坏）。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/trident_call_thunderstorm-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"trident_call_thunderstrorm\"></p></div>\n<p>涂蜡方块检测器</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;潜行时手持望远镜，涂蜡的铜方块会发出粒子效果。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/waxBlockIndicator-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"waxBlockCheck\"></p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>生物调整与行为</h3>\n<p>九命猫（默认禁用）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;猫拥有9条命</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/9_lives_cat-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Cat has 9 lives\"></p></div>\n<p>静音名牌</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>名牌包含“silent”或“shutup”将使生物保持沉默</p></div>\n<p>幼崽名牌</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>名牌包含“baby”将强制动物幼崽永远不长大</p></div>\n<p>可梳理的鹦鹉/鸡</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;梳理鹦鹉或鸡会掉落羽毛。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/brushChickenParrot.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Brush Parrot/Chicken\"></p></div>\n<p>爆炸嗅探者</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;右键向嗅探者投放粉末（火药、烈焰粉、糖、红石粉、萤石粉）使其嗅探，然后……<br>“以此教导孩子们不要嗅闻不明物体。”<br>- Faewulf</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/ExplodeSniffer.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Explosive Sniffer\"></p></div>\n<p>山羊掉落羊毛和羊肉</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>击杀山羊时会掉落羊毛和羊肉。</p></div>\n<p>嗅探者在苔藓块上嗅探</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;嗅探者在苔藓块上嗅探时会掉落花簇或小型垂滴叶。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/snifferMossBlock.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Sniffer on Moss Block\"></p></div>\n<p>抚摸你的宠物</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;按住Shift并右键点击你的宠物（狼、猫、马、鹦鹉）以抚摸它们。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/patYourpets.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Pat Your Pet\"></p></div>\n<p>狐狸埋藏物品</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;狐狸可以将物品埋在沙子或砾石中。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/foxBuryItems.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Fox Bury Items\"></p></div>\n<p>更小的蜜蜂（仅1.21版本）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;蜜蜂现在只有默认尺寸的一半。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/smallerBee.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Smaller Bees\"></p></div>\n<p>随机大小的鱼/鱿鱼（仅1.21版本）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;鱼和鱿鱼现在具有随机的大小。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/randomSizeFishes.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Random Size Fish/Squid\"></p></div>\n<p>猪灵和金制镶边盔甲</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;猪灵会将金制镶边盔甲视为金盔甲对待。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/piglinGoldenTrim-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Piglin and Golden Armor\"></p></div>\n<p>驯服的马/驴/骡子不再游荡</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;佩戴鞍具的已驯服动物将不会四处游荡。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/noWanderingTamedHorse.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Tamed Horse/Donkey/Mule\"></p></div>\n<p>马/骡子/驴/骆驼可以乘坐船只</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;马、驴、骡子和骆驼可以挤进船里！</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/horseSitOnBoat.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Horses in Boats\"></p></div>\n<p>草垛上的鸡蛋在消失后自动孵化</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;放置在草垛上的鸡蛋会在其消失后尝试孵化。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/eggOnGroundTryHatch-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Egg hatch despawn\"></p></div>\n<p>兔子食用胡萝卜作物后可繁殖。</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/rabbitAutoBreedWithCarrotCrops-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"RabbitAutoBreed\"></p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>雪傀儡产生细雪</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/snowGolemGivesPowderSnow.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"SnowGolemProducesPowderSnow\"></p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>流浪商人广播</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>当流浪商人出现时向玩家发送消息。</p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>命令</h3>\n<p>/slimechunkcheck （已在v2.1.0中移除）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>检查玩家所处区块是否为史莱姆区块的命令。</p></div>\n<p>/emote</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>在聊天中播放喵、呼噜、噗罗呜和汪等声音。灵感源自插件 [PlayerMeowing](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fplugin%252fplayermeowing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/plugin/playermeowing</a>)</p></div>\n<p>未定义</p>\n<h3>诅咒内容</h3>\n<p>憎水鞘翅（默认禁用）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;鞘翅不能在雨中或水中使用。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/cursed/hydrophobic_elytra-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Hydrophobic_elytra\"></p></div>\n<p>末地石是奶酪（默认禁用）（仅限1.21版本）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>你可以吃掉末地石 :)</p></div>\n<p>反向幻翼生成条件（默认禁用）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>如果玩家连续睡觉跳过夜晚，幻翼将会生成。</p></div>\n<hr>\n<h2>⚙️ 使用方法</h2>\n<p>客户端：可通过ModMenu访问配置界面。</p>\n<p>服务器端：几乎所有功能均可通过配置文件切换：config/diversity.toml</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>⚠️ 所需模组</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fabric API</li>\n<li>Faewulf's Lib</li>\n<li>（可选）权限管理模组，如“Luck Perms”</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>🪧 权限</h2>\n<p>⚠️ **注意！** 在模组版本2.0.0及更高版本中，此权限系统将被移除，目前替换为使用Minecraft内置的权限等级。<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fOps.json_format)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处查看更多</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如果通过配置文件启用了“权限模式”（默认禁用），你可以通过任何权限管理模组来管理功能。<br>\n*请注意，如果启用了权限模式但未安装权限管理模组，Diversity将无法正常运行。</p>\n<p>目前仅有以下2项权限：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>权限</th>\n<th>权限等级（2.0.0以上）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>/emote</td>\n<td>diversity.emote</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>/slimechunkcheck*</td>\n<td>diversity.slimechunkcheck*</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li>(*) 已在v2.1.0中移除</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>🛠️ 兼容性</h2>\n<p>Diversity旨在与其他Fabric模组兼容。如果遇到任何问题，请在模组的Issue追踪器中报告。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>👍 支持</h2>\n<p>如需支持、功能请求或Bug报告，请访问模组的GitHub Issues页面。或加入我的Discord服务器：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaewulf.xyz%252fdiscord%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">链接</a></p>\n<div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaewulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"kofi-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252ffaewulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"paypal-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/paypal-singular_vector.svg\"></a></div>\n<hr>\n<h2>📜 许可证</h2>\n<p>只要给予适当的署名，你可以在整合包中使用此模组。</p>\n<p>未定义</p>",
